h Single" plays. By playing the Queens with a single 3, I utilize my blockers (Kings and Aces held) to ensure the Queens are virtually unbeatable (opponents cannot have KKK or AAA), forcing out a Bomb or 222, or allowing me to clear a junk card safely.\n\nReason: Playing `triple_with_single: ♣3 ♠Q ♥Q ♦Q` effectively clears a low junk card (`♣3`) while leveraging the high strength of the `QQQ` triplet. Since I hold the Kings and Aces, opponents are blocked from playing the most common counters (KKK, AAA), leaving them only with the option to use a Bomb or 222, which is an excellent trade for me. This move maintains initiative better than a weak single and clears the hand more efficiently than a wingless airplane.\n\nAnswer: {"cards": ["♣3", "♠Q", "♥Q", "♦Q"]}'}
